{
  "id": "ss.terrain.tree-stalk",
  "name": "Cave stalk (SS)",
  "description": "The Spider Cave's thin tree: a fungal stalk with one wide cap, the shape a player reads as a tree at a glance without anything on it having leaves \u2014 nothing with leaves grows under a roof. Banded up the stem where it has grown in courses, gilled under the cap, and lit along the cap's rim with the same spore-teal the cave's glowing fungi carry, so a grove of these is what light there is down there. The cap is the `crown` half, which the game draws over whatever walks under it; the stem is the `trunk` half, which is what stops you.",
